  "story": {
    "title": "Picture Conversations-Action Words",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "I love lemon juice. I drink lemon juice everyday from Ramu thatha's shop. What do you like to drink?",
      "I like to eat sambar rice everyday. I love to eat sambar rice made by Amma. What do you like to eat?",
      "I like to kick a ball. I kick and play football everyday. What do you like to play?",
      "I sleep every night. I like to listen to stories before I go to sleep. I like to sleep on my mother's lap. What do you like to do before you go to sleep?",
      "I like to watch cartoons in TV. My Amma does not like me watching TV. What do you like to watch in TV?"
    ],
